ue" class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view UserMessage-module__ngynjq__userMessageContent"><div class="rendered-markdown"><div class="Markdown-module__eSbD4q__markdownTheme Markdown-module__eSbD4q__inheritShadesTextColor"><p>Create a professional Arabic forex and gold trading website.</p>
<p>Style:</p>
<ul>
<li>Modern and clean</li>
<li>Blue and white colors</li>
<li>Mobile responsive</li>
<li>Arabic language RTL</li>
<li>Hero section with trading background image</li>
<li>Big title about gold and forex analysis</li>
<li>Add a Telegram button</li>
<li>Add sections:
<ul>
<li>Live Gold Price</li>
<li>Forex Signals</li>
<li>Market News</li>
<li>Trading Tips</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p>Website name:<br>
Forex Morocco</p>
