OG__content" style="--useView--gap: 8px;"><div class="rendered-markdown"><div class="Markdown-module__eSbD4q__markdownTheme"><p>Two issues: metals.live redirects (not JSON), and I used the wrong Yahoo Finance ticker. Let me fix both simultaneously — switch to <code class="CodeRenderer2-module__jfz9nq__inline">GC=F</code> (gold futures, which worked before) and add defensive field checking on the frontend.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view EventContainer-module__w_fMqa__eventContainer" style="--useView--pt: 2px; --useView--pb: 2px;"><button class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view useView-module__vOh_Ha__isHorizontal ToolUseGroup-module__sZ38ga__toolUseGroupButton Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__shades Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__root Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__transition Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__disabled _sdz_text _sdz_surface-bg _sdz_custom-hover:shades-up-2 _sdz_custom-pressed:shades-up-3 Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__borderRadius Interactive2-module__BR3hWq__focus" style="--useView--gap: 8px; --useView--align: center; --useView--pt: 4px; --useView--pr: 4px; --useView--pb: 4px; --useView--pl: 4px; --Interactive2--border-radius: 12px;"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view useView-module__vOh_Ha__isHorizontal" style="--useView--align: center; --useView--shrink: 1;"><div style="display: inline-block;"><div class=" useView-module__vOh_Ha__view _sdz_surface-bg _sdz_surface _sdz_surface-border _sdz_surface-border-strength-subtle ToolUsePrimitives-module__A3-RwW__iconSurface ToolUseGroup-module__sZ38ga__eventIconContainer" style="--useView--justify: center; --useView--align: center; --useView--pt: 4px; --useView--pr: 4px; --useView--pb: 4px; --useView--pl: 4px; --useView--border-radius: var(--border-radius-8);"><svg preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="var(--foreground-dimmest)" class="Icon-module__CwnszW__icon " aria-hidden="true" style="--Icon--size: 16px; --Icon--rotate: 0deg